    "difficultyReason": "The parts scaffold the whole task: Ava's age, both future ages, the equation, then the solution. The student must read '125 more than the product' correctly and expand two binomial products. The x² terms then cancel, leaving a simple linear equation with no factorising or root rejection. It is similar to the scaffolded rectangle task p13-q1, but with less structure to interpret than the unscaffolded room-dimension problem p22-q32.",
